    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Vintage Gold Cake Serving Set | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the Vintage Gold Cake Serving Set by XINCHEN Kitchen, selected by KASODI for its polished gold finish, ornate engraving and elegant design for cakes, desserts and special occasions."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/tableware">Tableware</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Vintage Gold Cake Serving Set</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/tableware/vintage-gold-cake-serving-set.png"
            alt="Vintage gold engraved cake knife and server set styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI FIND · TABLEWARE
          </p>

          <h1>
            Vintage Gold Cake Serving Set
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            XINCHEN Kitchen
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            An elegant two-piece cake serving set in polished gold-tone
            stainless steel, finished with delicate vintage-inspired engraving.
            Designed to turn even a simple cake, tart or dessert into a more
            considered table moment.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>410 Stainless Steel</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Set</span>
              <strong>Cake Knife · Cake Server</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Knife</span>
              <strong>28.2 × 2.7 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Server</span>
              <strong>26.4 × 5.4 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Finish</span>
              <strong>Polished Gold · Engraved</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Ideal for</span>
              <strong>Cakes · Tarts · Desserts</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://temu.to/k/ewpec3cvucp"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            This is exactly the kind of small table detail KASODI looks for:
            useful, decorative and capable of changing the feeling of a setting
            without changing everything around it. The warm gold finish brings
            a subtle sense of occasion, while the ornamental engraving gives
            the pieces a more collected, vintage character.
          </p>

          <p>
            We especially like the set for birthdays, afternoon tea, dinner
            parties and celebratory desserts, but it is elegant enough to make
            an ordinary weekend cake feel special. Paired with floral
            porcelain, natural linen or simple cream tableware, it becomes a
            beautiful finishing detail rather than something reserved only for
            formal occasions.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Keep the gold finish looking beautiful</h2>

        <p>
          The product listing describes the set as dishwasher safe. For a
          polished decorative finish like this, gentle hand washing with a soft
          sponge and mild detergent can help preserve the shine and engraved
          detailing for longer. Avoid abrasive cleaners or rough scouring pads.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Floral Porcelain</h3>
            <p>
              Romantic floral plates or teacups echo the vintage character of
              the engraving and create a beautifully collected table.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Natural Linen</h3>
            <p>
              Oatmeal, ivory or warm beige linen softens the polished gold and
              keeps the setting relaxed rather than overly formal.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Textured Glassware</h3>
            <p>
              Clear or softly coloured textured glasses add another layer of
              detail while allowing the engraved gold pieces to remain the
              highlight.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>TABLEWARE</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/new-finds/fanquare-blue-floral-dessert-plates"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/fanquare-blue-floral-dessert-plates.png"
                alt="Blue Floral Dessert Plates"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>TABLEWARE</span>
              <h3>Blue Floral Dessert Plates</h3>
              <p>fanquare</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/new-finds/joeyan-green-champagne-glasses"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/joeyan-green-champagne-glasses.png"
                alt="Vintage Green Champagne Glasses"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>GLASSWARE</span>
              <h3>Vintage Green Champagne Glasses</h3>
              <p>Joeyan</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/kasodi-edit/boston-green-wine-glass"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/kasodi-edit/kasodi-edit-villeroy-boch-boston-green-glass.png"
                alt="Boston Green Wine Glass"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>GLASSWARE</span>
              <h3>Boston Green Wine Glass</h3>
              <p>Villeroy & Boch</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          XINCHEN KITCHEN · GOLD SERVING SET
        </p>

        <h2>
          The little detail that makes dessert feel like an occasion.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://temu.to/k/ewpec3cvucp"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>